      "environment": "Writable isolated fixtures; full baseline source context and existing public evals retained, project009 decision context/new rubric excluded. Official skill-creator provided after initial environment-failed run. Python sandbox launch failure resolved by the ordinary require_escalated path for both conditions; no safety control disabled.",
